    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati Ntemi Wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'witūnja wakwe Yehoshafati wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi; ūpandīka nguzu wīheeba ī Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūūla bashilikale pye a hose ū mu mizengo ya Yuda īyo yalī īpīndīlījiwe ndugu; pyī nū mu mizengo ī yīngī ī ya mu Yuda, nī ya mu Efulaimu īyo walī wīdima ise Asa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA walī hamò nang'hwe ū Yehoshafati, nguno washimīzīlaga ū mu nhūngwa ja kwandya ī ja ng'wa ise, ūmo washimīzīlaga Daūdi. Atagemile kūkooba būgunanhwa kūfuma kū Mabaalī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū wei walī na būlīngīsīji wa kū nkooba Mulungu o ng'wa ise, na kūlondeela shilagīlo shakwe, atashimīzīlile ū mu nzīla ja Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūbūguzuhya ū būtemi a ha sīlīlī yakwe; pye a banhū ba Yuda būyūng'wenhela shakwinha ū Yehoshafati; ūsaba no, hangī ūbiza n'ikūjo itaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'holò yakwe yalī īlolile mu nzīla ja ng'wa SEEBA, nīyo ūgīnja ū mu Yuda a mapandī a ga higūlya, nī ng'hīngī ja ng'wa Ashela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'waka gwa kadatū gwa būsugi wakwe, ūtūma batūmami bakwe, Beni-haili, Obadia, Zakalia, Nesaneeli na Mikaya; ūbatūma ū mu mizengo ya Yuda baje bakūlangaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būja hamò na Balawī balebe, Shemaya, Nesania, Zebadia, Asaheeli, Shemilamoti, Yehonasani, Adonia, Tobia na Tobu-adonia. Ū mu Balawī benabo baalīmo na bagabīji, ba Elishama na Yeholamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būja hose hose ū mu Yuda bakūlangaga, nī shitabo sha shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA būshisola, būja bakwīyeelelaga pyī ī mizengo ya Yuda bakūbalangaga a banhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwīlūkīlwa kwa ng'wa Yehoshafati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lyogohya lya ng'wa SEEBA lyūjigwīla pye sī ījo jalī jīpīndīlīgije ī Yuda; na lūūlū batagemile kūndumīla ū Yehoshafati kwilwisha būlūgū nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo Bafilisiti bamò na bamò būng'wenhela ū Yehoshafati shakwinha na feza ja goodi; na Baalabu būng'wenhela madaale ga ng'holo na mbūlīi, ng'ondi shihūmbī mpungatī na magana mpungatī, na ngulyati ja mbūli shihūmbī mpungatī na magana mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati ongeja kūbiza na nguzu; ūzenga ng'hambī ningī ja bashilikale ū mu Yuda, hamòna mizengo ya kūbīkīla shikolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbīka shikolo shingī ū mu mizengo ya Yuda. Ū mu Yelusalemu ūtūūla mo bashilikale, banhū abo baalī bamanīīlile mihayo ya būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkū kwene kwihela kwa mina gabo: Ū kūfuma ī Yuda; a bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī shihūmbī baalī, Adina; ntaale wa bashilikale shihūmbī magana adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlondeela Yehohanani; ntaale wa bashilikale shihūmbī magana abīlī na makūmi anaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlondeela Amasia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zikili; ntaale wa bashilikale shihūmbī magana abīlī. Ū ng'wenūyo akifunya hamò na a bashilikale bakwe kūlwa kūntūmamīla SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ī Benjamini baalīho, Eliada, nshilikale nshisha ng'holò; walī ntaale wa bashilikale shihūmbī magana abīlī, abo baalī na būta na mūda jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlondeela Yehozabadi, na bashilikale bakwe shihūmbī igana na makūmi anaane; banhū ba būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benaba hū baalī banhū abo bantūmamīlaga ū ntemi, kūleka kūbabala abo walī wabatūūla ū mu mizengo īyo yalī īpīndīlījiwe ndugu hose pyī ū mu Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
